---
---

<section class="py-24 lg:py-40" aria-labelledby="features-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-header">
      <h2 id="features-heading" class="section-title">
        Why <span class="gradient-text">kube-triage</span>?
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Bridge the gap between raw Kubernetes errors and actionable fixes in seconds, not hours.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
      <article class="card card-hover group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-brand-100 dark:bg-brand-900/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mb-3">Multi-Resource Collection</h3>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">Collects from Pods, Deployments, StatefulSets, DaemonSets, Jobs, CronJobs, Services, Endpoints, Ingress, NetworkPolicies, PVCs, PVs, and Nodes.</      </article>

      <article class="card card-hover group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-kube-100 dark:bg-kube-900/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-kube-600 dark:text-kube-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m13.56.707l-.707-.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M12 18v-1m0-10v-1" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mb-3">Hybrid Analysis Engine</h3>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">Fast path: 15 deterministic rules for instant detection. Deep path: AI reasoning (NVIDIA Nemotron, Ollama, OpenAI, Anthropic) for complex failures.</      </article>

      <article class="card card-hover group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mb-3">Production-Safe Remediation</h3>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">Generates exact kubectl patch/edit commands. Dry-run mode for safety. Auto-approve for automation. Deployment name auto-resolution.</      </article>

      <article class="card card-hover group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mb-3">Beautiful Terminal UI</h3>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">Neo-brutalist dark mode theme with color-coded severity levels, structured tables, and copy-pasteable commands.
      </article>

      <article class="card card-hover group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-orange-100 dark:bg-orange-900/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mb-3">15 Deterministic Rules</h3>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">KT-001 through KT-015 covering OOMKilled, CrashLoopBackOff, ImagePullBackOff, FailedMount, FailedScheduling, and more.
      </article>

      <article class="card card-hover group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-pink-100 dark:bg-pink-900/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-pink-600 dark:text-pink-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3.34 3.34 0 00-3.34-3.34 3.34 3.34 0 00-3.34 3.34" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mb-3">Multiple Output Formats</h3>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">Terminal (default), JSON for CI/CD pipelines, YAML for configuration. Structured data for automation.
      </article>

      <article class="card card-hover group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-100 dark:bg-cyan-900/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065 2.572c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z" />
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mb-3">4 AI Providers</h3>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">NVIDIA Nemotron (primary), Ollama local, OpenAI GPT-4o, Anthropic Claude. Auto-detection with graceful fallback chain.
      </article>

      <article class="card card-hover group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-100 dark:bg-indigo-900/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mb-3">Shell Completion</h3>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">Full tab completion for PowerShell, Bash, and Zsh. Context-aware suggestions for flags, resources, and namespaces.
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>